entor-element elementor-element-4ed9877 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4ed9877\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"292\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/v1aril123-300x292.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-2676\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/v1aril123-300x292.png 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/v1aril123-768x748.png 768w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/v1aril123.png 985w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-beac1cc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"beac1cc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abc56e8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"abc56e8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f17a53 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8f17a53\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Varil pompaları</strong>, varil, bidon ve silindir tipi depolama tanklarındaki sıvıların hızlı, kontrollü ve ergonomik bir şekilde transfer edilmesine olanak sağlayan endüstriyel ekipmanlardır. Yağ, kimyasal, solvent, yakıt ve diğer akışkanların taşınmasında ideal performans sunar.</p><p>HD Marine varil pompaları; dayanıklı yapısı, kolay montajı ve geniş uygulama uyumu ile hem endüstriyel tesislerde hem de marin süreçlerde güvenilir bir sıvı transfer çözümüdür.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1442d9c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1442d9c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4f8f78 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"c4f8f78\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVaril Pompası – Teknik Değerler\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1005304 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1005304\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Pozitif Deplasmanlı Varil Pompası</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kullanım Alanı</td><td width=\"329\">Varil, bidon, tank transferi</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Debi</td><td width=\"329\">15 – 150 L/dk</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç</td><td width=\"329\">2 – 6 bar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi</td><td width=\"329\">PP / Alüminyum / Paslanmaz Çelik / PVDF</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\"> O-Ring / Conta</td><td width=\"329\">Buna / Viton / PTFE</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bağlantı Çapı</td><td width=\"329\">½” – 1¼”</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Emme Uzunluğu</td><td width=\"329\">500 – 1800 mm (ayarlanabilir)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">-10°C – +80°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Motor / Sürücü</td><td width=\"329\">Elle / Elektrikli / Havalı</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05191c8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"05191c8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6470f0d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6470f0d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c38dbf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5c38dbf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3337ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c3337ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Varil Pompası Özellikleri</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26f9e98 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"26f9e98\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ <strong>Pratik montaj:</strong> Çeşitli varil çaplarına uygundur<br />✔ <strong>Dayanıklı yapı:</strong> Kimyasal ve solvent dayanımı yüksek materyaller<br />✔ <strong>Çeşitli sürüş seçenekleri:</strong> Elle, elektrikli veya havalı çalışma<br />✔ <strong>Kolay kullanım:</strong> Ergonomik pompa yapısı ile hızlı transfer<br />✔ <strong>Geniş uygulama uyumu:</strong> Yağ, yakıt, kimyasal, asit, baz transferi</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d56fc6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2d56fc6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-225dfa4 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"225dfa4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6a24acf8892b5\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-225dfa4\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d9bc4456a24acf8892b5\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d9bc4456a24acf8892b5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d9bc4456a24acf8892b5\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Varil pompası nedir?</span>\n\n                            \n                      